# Data, caches, outputs and model weights never go to version control:
#  - size: GitHub rejects files > 100 MB (SAD_v1.zip 186 MB, zenodo_pilot.parquet 121 MB, each model ~500 MB)
#  - privacy: raw/ and processed/ hold real Reddit post text (raw Zenodo files still have `author`)
#  - licences: some sources may not be redistributed (TensiStrength academic-only, Dreaddit licence UNVERIFIED)
#  - all of it is rebuildable: Step 1 downloads raw/, Step 2 rebuilds processed/ (manifests hold SHA-256), Step 3 trains
# EXCEPTIONS: small, text-free files needed for reproducibility and for the record of what ran.
# (`dir/**` + `!dir/**/` keeps the folders traversable so the `!` exceptions below can take effect.)
data/**
!data/**/
!data/processed/splits/*.json
!data/outputs/manifests/*.json
!data/outputs/reports/*.md

trained_models/**
!trained_models/**/
!trained_models/HANDOFF.md
!trained_models/handoff.json
!trained_models/**/metrics.json
!trained_models/**/model_card.md
!trained_models/**/stress_config.json
!trained_models/**/manifest.json
!trained_models/**/train_summary.json
!trained_models/**/evaluation*.json
!trained_models/**/calibration.json
!trained_models/**/FINAL_TEST_REPORT.json
!trained_models/**/shortcut_masking.json
!trained_models/**/loso_summary.json
!trained_models/**/emotion_config.json
!trained_models/**/thresholds.json
!trained_models/**/ekman_mapping.json
!trained_models/**/domain_shift_dreaddit.json
!trained_models/**/stressor_config.json
!trained_models/**/stressors_v*.yaml
!trained_models/**/lr_summary.json
!trained_models/**/seed_selection.json
!trained_models/**/SAD_TEST_REPORT.json
!trained_models/**/GOLD_TEST_REPORT.json
!trained_models/**/kappa.json
!trained_models/**/kinds.json
!trained_models/**/DONE.json
!trained_models/**/train_log.csv
!trained_models/**/c_selection_validation.csv
!trained_models/**/threshold_curve_*.csv
!trained_models/**/reliability_*.png
!trained_models/**/predictions_*.parquet
!trained_models/stress/v*/config.json
!trained_models/**/dreaddit_crosscheck.json
.env
code/_deferred/.env

